    {
      "name": "Stock Ledger",
      "description": "Stock overview balances and live SSE deltas.\n\n**Table:** `stock_balance` (projected from `stock_entry`).\n\n**Overview list:** `GET /stock/balances/` snapshot + `GET /stock/balances/stream/` upsert/remove deltas.\n\n**Detail:** entry / mass-balance / ATP stay on normal REST — not streamed.\n\n**Vars:** `{{base_url}}`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List balances",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/stock/balances/",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["stock", "balances", ""],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "lot_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Optional. Filter to one lot.",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "location_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Optional. Filter to one location.",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "### List balances\n\n`GET /stock/balances/`\n\nReturns projected on-hand rows for the stock overview grid (first load / SSE fallback). Cap 500 rows. Use with `GET /stock/balances/stream/` for live deltas — do not poll this as the primary live path.\n\n**Path parameters**\n\nNone.\n\n**Query parameters**\n\n| Name | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `lot_id` | optional | Filter to one lot |\n| `location_id` | optional | Filter to one location |\n\n**Request body**\n\n**None**.\n\n**Response body**\n\n`{ status, message: \"Balances fetched.\", data: [ row... ] }`\n\nEach row includes `lot_id`, `location_id`, `location_name`, product fields, `quantity`, `quantity_base`, `last_entry_id`, `updated_at`, lot dates/trace.\n\n**Status codes**\n\n| Code | When |\n| --- | --- |\n| 200 | Success |"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Stream balances (SSE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "text/event-stream"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/stock/balances/stream/",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["stock", "balances", "stream", ""]
            },
            "description": "### Stream balances (SSE)\n\n`GET /stock/balances/stream/`\n\nServer-Sent Events stream of **per-row** balance deltas for the stock overview list only. FE: initial `GET /stock/balances/` then apply `upsert` / `remove` via AG Grid `applyTransaction`. Does **not** push the full list. Detail pages keep using REST.\n\nEmitted after receipt / issue / transfer / disposal / count-adjustment / reversal (after DB commit, coalesced ~150ms). Heartbeat comment `: ping` about every 20s.\n\n**Path parameters**\n\nNone.\n\n**Query parameters**\n\nNone.\n\n**Request body**\n\n**None**.\n\n**Response body**\n\n`Content-Type: text/event-stream`\n\nEach event:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"upsert\" | \"remove\",\n  \"at\": \"2026-07-31T09:00:00+00:00\",\n  \"row\": { /* upsert: same fields as GET /stock/balances/ row; remove: lot_id + location_id */ }\n}\n```\n\n`remove` when projected quantity is `0`.\n\n**Status codes**\n\n| Code | When |\n| --- | --- |\n| 200 | Stream open (long-lived) |"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
